# Tuning In (windurst 90), completion parity: 886's finish is npcUtil.completeQuest step for step (the gil with
# GIL_OBTAINED, the title), ending in the raw player:completeQuest, so a GM's Quest[2][90]Prog survives the completion
# (quest:cleanup, which a called Quest.Complete() runs, would clear it). Accepted (GM) beside Leepe-Hoppe.
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=12.9,-9.7,-197.5 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Windurst.TuningIn accepted
item MagickedSteelIngot
item PieceOfSpruceLumber
item ExtraFineFile
login
charvar Quest[2][90]Prog 1              # a GM: the quest's own var (the raw completeQuest keeps it)
trade Leepe-Hoppe MagickedSteelIngot x1 PieceOfSpruceLumber x1 ExtraFineFile x1  # accepted: 886
finish                                  # 4000 gil; GIL_OBTAINED 4000; Fine Tuner; completed; the items taken; Prog kept
